{"id":"vod_sn_36549","vodId":"36549","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"握手者","name_cn":"握手者","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5f75c45320969a1cefc6e24bf43c40ce.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个虚拟的奇幻世界之中。在这里，相对应的两人将手牵在一起，所产生的心灵连结“宁录”能够成为拥有着强大力量的武器。在传说中，这个世界上存在着掌控着一切的神，只要将神打败，就能够实现内心最强烈的愿望。长久以来，握手者们都将打败神作为目标，不断地战斗着，而一切因果的汇聚点就在大阪。　　高槻手纲（齐藤壮马 配音）是对机械十分着迷的男子高中生，一次偶然中，他在研究室里邂逅了昏睡中的少女芥川小代理（诸星堇 配音）。手纲牵住了小代理的手，想不到小代理竟然从昏睡中醒来，两人成为了搭档。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GA1ZKQVbSH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FBpZxBwif31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FHvVmyb8Y91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ayG1S32dx11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vS6nTy8UQn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C6i0PZGnA21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3z3PVAj3Dg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ghnKHigAhQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9acRmEDAj11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/smbxkQVaPJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SX1RdJT9bL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sx6J4gy9jx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VVLuMKNYzZ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.206Z"}